        {"zh": "它贴着水线往礁石去。", "en": "It follows the waterline toward the rocks."},
        {"zh": "大螯举着，像两把小刀。", "en": "Its big claws are up like two small knives."},
        {"zh": "浪退下去，它跟着走。", "en": "The wave pulls back, and it follows."},
        {"zh": "它钻进沙洞，只留螯尖。", "en": "It burrows into the sand, leaving only claw tips."}
      ]
